<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Cuenta verificada | Flavorwell</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/_UI_img/logo_small.png" type="image/x-icon">
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            background-color: #fff;
            color: rgb(0, 0, 0);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            max-width: 480px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .logo {
            max-width: 50px;
        }

        .image {
            max-width: 250px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #E3170A;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .thanks {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #F7B32B;
        }

        .close-info {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #888;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dqizoxubr/image/upload/v1750291657/logo_small_bsfqxw.png"
            alt="Flavorwell Logo" class="logo">
        <h1>Flavorwell</h1>
        <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dqizoxubr/image/upload/v1750293575/cupcake-restore_mvktcv.png"
            alt="Account Verified" class="image">
        <h1>Cuenta verificada!</h1>
        <p class="thanks">Gracias por verificar su cuenta Flavorwell.</p>
        <p class="close-info">Ya puedes cerrar esta pestaña y disfrutar de nuestra plataforma 🎉</p>
    </div>
</body>

</html>